			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3852004">
									

<p>&quot;Paul is dead&quot; isn't creepy. It's literally just an average conspiracy theory about some famous person dying and being replaced by a clone. People come up with crazy stuff like that all the time, it should be treated with the same lack of respect as the flat earth conspiracy theory gets.</p>
<p>There is nothing about The Beatles that make this SCP creepy. I wouldn't even call it creepy, unsettling is a better word. Anyways, what makes this SCP so unsettling is the fact that it refuses to answer questions about The Beatles. The part at the end definetely suggests that this album was made specially for someone by The Beatles. And if they made this, then they aren't normal musical artists, they are anartists. And who knows what other anamolous art The Beatles made? Chances are this isn't the only anamolous record.</p>

